<!--
    Authored one-formal custom-storage call transport, P5 callable types.
    probe preserves its object in RCX and moves getter's EAX return into EDX
    before calling mapper. mapper reads EDX only. The explicit slot-0 storage
    must override MSABI's normal ECX slot without introducing a dummy receiver.
    This is a correctness fix; the ordinary two-slot declaration is a control.

    The additional authored callee returns its EDI argument plus seven. A
    return-only EAX declaration must retain that inferred argument through
    rebuilds, and its caller must keep passing eleven. Explicit parameter
    storage and a fully declared zero-input function calibrate the boundary.
-->
